  "id": "educational-tests",
  "term": "educational tests",
  "definition": "Educational tests are assessments used in education in which people’s answers, and sometimes how long they take to respond, can be analyzed. The source indicates that these tests may measure more than one underlying ability or trait and can also show broader general effects across test items.",
